// Public synthetic example for authored skippable timed waits.
@chapter wait_demo "Skippable timed wait"
@scene start

「This pause keeps its full authored duration.」
@wait 0.5

「This pause may end on left click, Space, Enter, gamepad A, or Skip.」
@wait 2.0 skippable=true

「Click mode has no timer and accepts no options.」
@wait click

「Done.」
